{"speciesId":460,"names":{"fr":"Blizzaroi","es":"Abomasnow","en":"Abomasnow","ja":"ユキノオー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It whips up blizzards in mountains that are always buried in snow. It is the abominable snowman."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It blankets wide areas in snow by whipping up blizzards. It is also known as “The Ice Monster.”"},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il apparaît quand les fleurs des terres enneigées fleurissent et se retire quand elles se fanent."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il apparaît quand les fleurs des terres enneigées fleurissent et se retire quand elles se fanent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"De larges zones sont recouvertes par la neige de ses blizzards. On l’appelle « monstre des glaces »."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Genera ventiscas con las que cubre de nieve grandes áreas. Se le llama el Monstruo de Hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It blankets wide areas in snow by whipping up blizzards. It is also known as “The Ice Monster.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ブリザードを 発生させて あたり 一面を 真っ白に してしまう。 別名 アイスモンスター。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il hante les sommets aux neiges éternelles, et se cache en déclenchant des blizzards."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en paz en cordilleras de nieves eternas. Genera ventiscas para ocultarse."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"万年雪が 積もる 山脈で 静かに 暮らす。ブリザードを 発生させて 姿を 隠す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"De larges zones sont recouvertes par la neige de ses blizzards. On l’appelle « monstre des glaces »."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Genera ventiscas con las que cubre de nieve grandes áreas. Se le llama el Monstruo de Hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It blankets wide areas in snow by whipping up blizzards. It is also known as “The Ice Monster.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ブリザードを 発生させて あたり 一面を 真っ白に してしまう。 別名 アイスモンスター。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il hante les sommets aux neiges éternelles, et se cache en déclenchant des blizzards."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vive en paz en cordilleras de nieves eternas. Genera ventiscas para ocultarse."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"万年雪が 積もる 山脈で 静かに 暮らす。ブリザードを 発生させて 姿を 隠す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il fait fuir les hordes de Darumarond qui s’en prennent aux Blizzi en se servant de ses grands bras comme de marteaux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword"